    <emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>8
  </item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> Does the graph open up or down? 
    
    <emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> The graph opens upward. The squared term has a positive coefficient \((1)\).
  </item>
</list>
