<para>What patterns do you notice? Can you use those ideas to find the vertices for the next equation? What do you know about whether it will open up or down?</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>Without graphing, find the coordinates of the vertex of \(y=-(x−4)^2+8\) and determine if it opens up or down.</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex? 
    
