</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item> What is the \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex? 
    
    <emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 8
  </item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item> Does the graph open up or down? 
    
    <emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>The graph opens downward. The squared term has a negative coefficient \((-1)\).
  </item>
</list>
